#==============================================================================================
#
#   math_ml_mspace_element - MathML::MathMLMspaceElement: <mspace> and its width, height and
#                            depth presentational hints
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/MathML/MathMLMspaceElement.cpp (lines 1-73): construction
#       (which moves the mixin tables to MathMLMspaceElement's, as C++'s vptrs move) and the
#       width, height and depth presentational hints.
